T*
(This Agreement is made on 25 August 2026 between Pearl River Commercial Bank, Foshan Branch \(the) Tj T*
("Bank"\) and Lingnan Homeware Manufacturing Co., Ltd. \(the "Borrower"\).) Tj T*
T*
(1. THE FACILITY) Tj T*
T*
(1.1 The Bank makes available to the Borrower a revolving working-capital credit line with a facility limit of) Tj T*
(RMB 150,000.) Tj T*
T*
(1.2 The Borrower shall use each drawing for its general working capital.) Tj T*
T*
(2. DRAWDOWN) Tj T*
T*
(2.1 Drawdowns are funded on the same day as the drawdown request.) Tj T*
T*
(2.2 The Borrower may repay and redraw any part of the credit line during its availability.) Tj T*
T*
(3. INTEREST AND FEES) Tj T*
T*
(3.1 The interest rate is 6.4% per annum, accruing daily on the amount drawn.) Tj T*
T*
(3.2 No arrangement fee, commitment fee or other fee is payable for the credit line.) Tj T*
T*
(4. REPAYMENT) Tj T*
T*
(4.1 Each drawing is repaid in a single bullet payment at the end of its interest period, and may be redrawn.) Tj T*
T*
(5. FINANCIAL COVENANTS) Tj T*
T*
(5.1 Debt service coverage: the Borrower shall maintain a debt service coverage ratio \(DSCR\) of at least 1.25) Tj T*
(times in each month.) Tj T*
T*
(5.2 Leverage: the total debt of the Borrower shall not exceed 2.5 times its annual EBITDA.) Tj T*
T*
(5.3 Clean-down: the outstanding balance of the credit line shall be reduced to zero for at least thirty \(30\)) Tj T*
(consecutive days in each year.) Tj T*
T*
(6. SECURITY) Tj T*
T*
(6.1 No personal guarantee, collateral or pledge is required under this Agreement.) Tj T*
T*
(7. GOVERNING LAW) Tj T*
T*
(7.1 This Agreement is governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China.) Tj T*
T*
(Signed for the Bank: Zhou Min, Relationship Manager. Date: 25 August 2026.) Tj T*
